.\" Generated by docs/reference/generate-man.py from cps --help.
.TH "CPS-LIST" 1 "" "CPS" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
\&cps\-list \- \&List installed packages, available versions, local intent, or freezes
.SH SYNOPSIS
.HP 4
.B \&cps list [OPTIONS] [PATTERN]...
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.B \&[PATTERN]...
\&Only list packages whose name, or its last component, matches one of these patterns; * and ? are wildcards
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \&\-\-root <IMAGE>
\&Image root (default: the running system) [default: /]
.TP
.B \&\-\-available
\&List the packages in the configured signed catalogs
.TP
.B \&\-\-all\-versions
\&With \-\-available, list every version instead of the newest
.TP
.B \&\-\-intent
\&Show local requests and roles in the installed release profile
.TP
.B \&\-\-frozen
\&List persistent package version freezes
.PP
.B \&\-\-json
.TP
.B \&\-h, \-\-help
\&Print help
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B \&0
\&Success. A check found nothing to report.
.TP
.B \&1
\&An error.
.TP
.B \&2
\&Invalid usage, such as an unknown option or a missing argument.
.TP
.B \&3
\&A check found something: updates are available (upgrade \-\-check), verification found problems (verify, publisher audit\-builds), pins are stale (recipe repin \-\-check), configuration or images differ (config diff, image diff), manifest dependencies are missing (manifest dependencies), or nothing matched (search, owner).
.TP
.B \&4
\&A confirmation prompt was declined.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR cps (1)
